      "notes": "No ADAS pack on Ignite per Moladin (MG Pilot is Magnify Max only). Launched IIMS February 2026. Prices on mgmotor.id (October 2026, OTR Jakarta, 'may change'): Ignite Rp333,900,000, Magnify Rp365,900,000, Magnify Max Rp409,900,000. Launch/special-program prices were Rp333.9 / 355.9 / 455.9 million (Moladin June 2026, CNN July 2026); GridOto reported a temporary Magnify Max OTR of Rp399.9 million to end of September 2026. Power 170 PS x0.7355 = 125 kW; 204 PS = 150 kW. Assembly (CKD/CBU) not confirmed. Gridoto also cites IP69K for the battery. Motor count, AC power, V2L output, 0–100 km/h, boot, seats and airbag positions from the Malaysian spec of the same 49 kWh, 168 hp RWD S5 EV Com (paultan.org); Malaysian ADAS not used because Indonesian sources differ by trim.",
      "notes_id": "Tidak ada paket ADAS di Ignite menurut Moladin (MG Pilot hanya ada di Magnify Max). Diluncurkan di IIMS Februari 2026. Harga di mgmotor.id (Oktober 2026, OTR Jakarta, 'dapat berubah'): Ignite Rp333.900.000, Magnify Rp365.900.000, Magnify Max Rp409.900.000. Harga peluncuran/program spesial adalah Rp333,9 / 355,9 / 455,9 juta (Moladin Juni 2026, CNN Juli 2026); GridOto melaporkan OTR sementara Magnify Max Rp399,9 juta hingga akhir September 2026. Tenaga 170 PS x0,7355 = 125 kW; 204 PS = 150 kW. Status perakitan (CKD/CBU) belum terkonfirmasi. Gridoto juga menyebut baterai berstandar IP69K. Jumlah motor, daya AC, output V2L, 0–100 km/jam, bagasi, kursi, dan posisi airbag dari spesifikasi Malaysia untuk S5 EV Com 49 kWh, 168 hp RWD yang sama (paultan.org); ADAS Malaysia tidak dipakai karena sumber Indonesia berbeda per varian."
